 para('The practical selection criteria were recorded before the alternate captures: at least 18 fresh FPS in every comparison window; relay-age P95 at most 350 ms; alternate outside-bed point fraction at most 25%; no added cloud send failures or queue drops; at least a 10 percentage-point two-recent-group gain in both frozen methods, with fragmentation increasing at most 5 points and zero-group time at most 1 point. These are engineering decision limits, not statistical significance or human detection accuracy.')
